{"id": "EUVD-2026-101095", "enisaUuid": "beefb3d0-90b3-3f5b-a8af-a91332f743f2", "description": "Gitea creates server-side Git hook directories and scripts with mode 0777 and relies on the process umask to restrict access. With a permissive umask such as 0000 or 0002, another local user who can reach the repository storage may modify a hook or add an executable to a writable hook directory. A later Git operation can execute that file as the Gitea service account.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:36:46", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:03:17", "baseScore": 5.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:H/A:L", "references": ["https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-pq8x-xpgp-rvmh", "https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.27.3/", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/39008", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/39016", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.27.3"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-70402"], "assigner": "Gitea", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "959aca81-71a4-356a-87d7-8db8236d7820", "product": {"name": "Gitea", "vendor": {"name": "Gitea"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.27.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0eaf6a63-527a-30db-b1ab-ab05d01024ca", "vendor": {"name": "Gitea"}}], "isExploited": false}